## 2. Authentication endpoints

### `POST /api/auth/login`

No token required.

```json
{
  "username": "alvina",
  "password": "the-teacher-password"
}
```

Success `200`:

```json
{
  "authenticated": true,
  "user": {
    "sub": "staff:stf_123",
    "name": "Alvin Ojiambo",
    "email": "alvina"
  },
  "tenant": {
    "id": "tnt_123",
    "name": "ElimuTrack School",
    "plan": "school",
    "owner_sub": "..."
  },
  "role": "teacher",
  "services": ["learners", "marks", "attendance", "progress"],
  "streams": ["Grade 7 Eta"],
  "staff": {
    "id": "stf_123",
    "name": "Alvin Ojiambo",
    "username": "alvina",
    "mustChangeLogin": false
  },
  "token": "elmt_..."
}
```

The same response also sets the `elmt_staff` cookie for browser use. AI Studio
should ignore the cookie and use `token`.

Errors:

| Status | Code | Meaning |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `400` | `VALIDATION` | Username or password missing |
| `401` | `BAD_CREDENTIALS` | Wrong username/password, or inactive account |
| `403` | `MUST_CHANGE_LOGIN` | Password must be changed before using the API |
| `500` | `NO_TENANT` | Staff account is not linked to a school |
| `500` | `LOGIN_FAILED` | Unexpected server failure |

If `staff.mustChangeLogin` is `true`, call `change-login` first.

### `GET /api/session`

Returns the current session. Requires the bearer token. Use it on app start to
restore the teacher, school, enabled modules and assigned classes.

The shape is the same as the login response without `token`.

### `POST /api/auth/change-login`

Required when `staff.mustChangeLogin` is `true`, or when the teacher wants to
change their own credentials.

```json
{
  "username": "new.username",
  "currentPassword": "old-password",
  "newPassword": "new-password"
}
```

`newPassword` must be at least 6 characters. `username` is optional; when
present it must be 3-32 characters using letters, numbers, dot, dash or
underscore.

Success `200`:

```json
{ "ok": true, "username": "new.username" }
```

Errors: `400 VALIDATION`, `401 BAD_CREDENTIALS`, `403 FORBIDDEN` (not a teacher
account), `409 DUPLICATE_USERNAME`.

The existing token keeps working after a change.

### `POST /api/auth/logout`

Requires the bearer token. Revokes that token.

Success `200`: `{ "ok": true }`

