## 6. Marks

### `GET /api/marks?stream=Grade%207%20Eta&learner=lrn_123`

`stream` is normally required; `learner` narrows to one learner.

```json
{
  "marks": [
    {
      "learnerId": "lrn_123",
      "subjectId": "math",
      "score": 78
    }
  ]
}
```

Scores are percentages from `0` to `100`.

### `PUT /api/marks`

Upsert a batch. Send only the changed cells.

```json
{
  "items": [
    { "learnerId": "lrn_123", "subjectId": "math", "score": 78 },
    { "learnerId": "lrn_124", "subjectId": "math", "score": 64 }
  ]
}
```

Success `200`: `{ "ok": true, "saved": 2 }`

Validation rejects a missing learner/subject, a score outside `0-100`, and a
learner outside the teacher's streams.

