## 9. Schemes of work

### `GET /api/schemes?stream=Grade%207%20Eta&subjectId=math&term=Term%201`

All query parameters are optional; use them to reduce the response.

```json
{
  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "sch_123",
      "stream": "Grade 7 Eta",
      "subjectId": "math",
      "term": "Term 1",
      "week": 3,
      "lesson": 2,
      "strand": "Numbers",
      "subStrand": "Whole numbers",
      "outcomes": "By the end of the lesson...",
      "experiences": "Learners to...",
      "inquiry": "How do we...?",
      "resources": "Counters, charts",
      "assessment": "Oral questions",
      "remarks": "",
      "staffId": "stf_123",
      "author": "Alvin Ojiambo",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-16T08:00:00.000Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

### `POST /api/schemes`

```json
{
  "stream": "Grade 7 Eta",
  "subjectId": "math",
  "term": "Term 1",
  "week": 3,
  "lesson": 2,
  "strand": "Numbers",
  "subStrand": "Whole numbers",
  "outcomes": "By the end of the lesson...",
  "experiences": "Learners to...",
  "inquiry": "How do we...?",
  "resources": "Counters, charts",
  "assessment": "Oral questions",
  "remarks": ""
}
```

`stream`, `subjectId`, `term`, `week` and `lesson` identify the row;
`subStrand` and `outcomes` are required content. A duplicate week/lesson in the
same class/subject/term returns `409 DUPLICATE_LESSON`.

Success `201`: `{ "row": { ...scheme row } }`

### `POST /api/schemes/bulk`

Use this for an entire term imported from a CSV or generated plan.

```json
{
  "stream": "Grade 7 Eta",
  "subjectId": "math",
  "term": "Term 1",
  "rows": [
    {
      "week": 1,
      "lesson": 1,
      "strand": "Numbers",
      "subStrand": "Whole numbers",
      "outcomes": "...",
      "experiences": "...",
      "inquiry": "...",
      "resources": "...",
      "assessment": "...",
      "remarks": ""
    }
  ]
}
```

Success `200`: `{ "ok": true, "saved": 12 }`

### `PUT /api/schemes`

Send the same fields plus the row `id`.

Success `200`: `{ "ok": true }`

### `DELETE /api/schemes`

```json
{ "id": "sch_123" }
```

Success `200`: `{ "ok": true }`

