## 16. Payments

### `GET /api/payments?stream=Grade%207%20Eta`

```json
{
  "payments": [
    {
      "id": "pay_123",
      "learnerId": "lrn_123",
      "learnerName": "Amina Wanjiku",
      "amount": 5000,
      "method": "mpesa",
      "reference": "QK123456",
      "day": "2026-11-16",
      "note": ""
    }
  ]
}
```

### `POST /api/payments`

```json
{
  "learnerId": "lrn_123",
  "amount": 5000,
  "method": "mpesa",
  "reference": "QK123456",
  "day": "2026-11-16",
  "note": ""
}
```

`learnerId`, `amount` and `method` are required. Allowed methods are `cash`,
`mpesa`, `bank` and `cheque`.

Success `201`: `{ "payment": { ...payment } }`

