## 17. WhatsApp

### `GET /api/whatsapp?learnerId=lrn_123`

```json
{
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "wam_123",
      "learnerId": "lrn_123",
      "learnerName": "Amina Wanjiku",
      "phone": "2547...",
      "message": "Fee balance: KES 10,000",
      "status": "SENT",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-16T08:00:00.000Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

### `POST /api/whatsapp`

```json
{
  "learnerId": "lrn_123",
  "message": "Fee balance: KES 10,000"
}
```

The learner must have a guardian phone number. Success `201`:

```json
{
  "message": {
    "id": "wam_123",
    "learnerId": "lrn_123",
    "learnerName": "Amina Wanjiku",
    "phone": "2547...",
    "message": "Fee balance: KES 10,000",
    "status": "SENT",
    "createdAt": "2026-11-16T08:00:00.000Z"
  }
}
```

A provider failure returns `502 WHATSAPP_FAILED`; the attempt is still logged.

