## 18. Broadsheet CSV

### `GET /api/broadsheet/csv?stream=Grade%207%20Eta`

Returns `text/csv` with a download filename. It is not JSON.

```js
const response = await fetch(
  `${API}/api/broadsheet/csv?stream=${encodeURIComponent(stream)}`,
  { headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${token}` }, credentials: "omit" }
);
const blob = await response.blob();
```

For an in-app table, build it from `GET /api/marks` instead.

